#!/bin/bash
# Managed by Ansible (deploy/ansible/roles/certs). Renews the TURN certificate if due and restarts LiveKit when the
# certificate changed (LiveKit reads it at start). Runs from cipheroom-cert-renew.timer in the night window.
set -euo pipefail
cert=/etc/letsencrypt/live/{{ certs_domain }}/fullchain.pem
before="$(sha256sum "$(readlink -f "$cert")" | cut -d' ' -f1)"
docker run --rm \
  -v /etc/letsencrypt:/etc/letsencrypt \
  -v /etc/cipheroom/cloudflare-dns.ini:/cloudflare-dns.ini:ro \
  {{ certs_certbot_image }} renew --quiet
after="$(sha256sum "$(readlink -f "$cert")" | cut -d' ' -f1)"
if [[ "$before" != "$after" ]]; then
  docker compose --project-directory {{ cipheroom_dir }} -f {{ cipheroom_dir }}/docker-compose.yml \
    --env-file {{ cipheroom_dir }}/.env --profile livekit restart livekit
fi
